<title>USA: Avondale completes asset securitization.</title>
<headline>Avondale completes asset securitization.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Avondale Financial Corp said Tuesday its trust subsidiary completed a $74.7 million private asset securitization backed by home equity lines of credit originated by its Avondale Federal Savings Bank.</p>
<p>The company estimated the gain on the sale of the receivables will be about $2 million, or $0.55 per share.</p>
<p>Avondale Financial is the parent of Avondale Federal Savings and Avondale Home Equity Loan Trust 1996-1.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787</p>
